                                                "sense_id": "0d429b7b-5510-3ad9-9dfa-83820441d1ed",
                                                "text": "\"Come in!\" says the gray spider to the house-fly; \"I have entertained a great many flies. I have plenty of room, fine meals and a gay life. [...] Philosophers have written volumes about my antennae and cephalothorax.\""
                                            }
